{"id":"50b67351e20f70ca","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-multivariate-normal.md","title":"Multivariate Normal","display":"df-multivariate-normal — Multivariate Normal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-multivariate-normal","aliases":["58-df-multivariate-normal"],"display":"df-multivariate-normal — Multivariate Normal","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-distribution.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-multivariate-normal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-multivariate-normal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-multivariate-normal — Multivariate Normal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c53fe47de39217ed\" href=\"?note=c53fe47de39217ed\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-distribution.md\">../batch03/58-df-distribution.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\\in\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mu\\in\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span> (dimension and mean)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n\\times n}\">\\(\\Sigma\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n\\times n}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\Sigma^T\">\\(\\Sigma=\\Sigma^T\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v^T\\Sigma v&gt;0\">\\(v^T\\Sigma v&gt;0\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathbb{R}^n\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(v\\in\\mathbb{R}^n\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> (nondegenerate covariance matrix)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal B_n\\in V\">\\(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal B_n\\in V\\)</span> (random vector, probability space, and Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultivariateNormalStructure}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{MultivariateNormalStructure}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multivariate\\text{-}normal\\text{-}density} \\vdash f_{n,\\mu,\\Sigma}(x)\\coloneqq \\frac{1}{(2\\pi)^{n/2}\\det(\\Sigma)^{1/2}}\\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu)^T\\Sigma^{-1}(x-\\mu)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multivariate\\text{-}normal\\text{-}density} \\vdash f_{n,\\mu,\\Sigma}(x)\\coloneqq \\frac{1}{(2\\pi)^{n/2}\\det(\\Sigma)^{1/2}}\\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu)^T\\Sigma^{-1}(x-\\mu)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multivariate\\text{-}normal} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MultivariateNormalStructure}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal B_n,n,\\mu,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\Omega,\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\mathcal B_n=\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mu\\in\\mathbb R^n\\land\\Sigma\\in\\mathbb R^{n\\times n}\\land\\Sigma=\\Sigma^T\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(v\\neq0\\to v^T\\Sigma v&gt;0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;\\left(\\mathbb P(X^{-1}[A])=\\int_A f_{n,\\mu,\\Sigma}(x)\\,dx\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multivariate\\text{-}normal} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MultivariateNormalStructure}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal B_n,n,\\mu,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\Omega,\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\mathcal B_n=\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mu\\in\\mathbb R^n\\land\\Sigma\\in\\mathbb R^{n\\times n}\\land\\Sigma=\\Sigma^T\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(v\\neq0\\to v^T\\Sigma v&gt;0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;\\left(\\mathbb P(X^{-1}[A])=\\int_A f_{n,\\mu,\\Sigma}(x)\\,dx\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the distributional definition of a nondegenerate multivariate normal random vector; the probability space and Borel structure are explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-distribution.md","status":"resolved","id":"c53fe47de39217ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-distribution.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu\\in\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n\\times n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\Sigma^T","display":false},{"tex":"v^T\\Sigma v>0","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathbb{R}^n\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal B_n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MultivariateNormalStructure}_S\\subseteq V^9","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multivariate\\text{-}normal\\text{-}density} \\vdash f_{n,\\mu,\\Sigma}(x)\\coloneqq \\frac{1}{(2\\pi)^{n/2}\\det(\\Sigma)^{1/2}}\\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu)^T\\Sigma^{-1}(x-\\mu)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multivariate\\text{-}normal} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{MultivariateNormalStructure}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal B_n,n,\\mu,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\quad \\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\Omega,\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\mathcal B_n=\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mu\\in\\mathbb R^n\\land\\Sigma\\in\\mathbb R^{n\\times n}\\land\\Sigma=\\Sigma^T\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(v\\neq0\\to v^T\\Sigma v>0)\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;\\left(\\mathbb P(X^{-1}[A])=\\int_A f_{n,\\mu,\\Sigma}(x)\\,dx\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1871,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-867","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-multivariate-normal.md|58-df-multivariate-normal]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["c53fe47de39217ed","0578a357a86e9d8f","36d7463d215be751"]}